# 9V supply module. Standalone-buildable AND includable:
# `use psu.ocd as PSU` ignores board size + fix, prefixes refs/nets,
# auto-joins VCC/GND into the parent.
board psu 20x12 2L
part J1 PINHD2 9V
part C1 C0805 100n
part C2 ELEC_6MM 10u
net VCC: J1.1 C1.1 C2.+
net GND: J1.2 C1.2 C2.-
fix J1 at 3 6
power VCC GND
